# v0.199.0-alpha Release Notes

Release: v0.199.0-alpha
Date: 2026-08-15
Tag: v0.199.0-alpha
Status: ALPHA (Road to Beta Phase 1 & 12-Agent Swarm Validation Milestone)

## Highlights

1. RTB-1: Essential Collections & Formats (std/hash/map.oo & std/markup/json.oo)
   - Delimiter-isolated deterministic HashMap with length-prefixed key serialization (`<len>:<key>\t<val>\n`).
   - Pure JSON parser & builder (`json_builder_*`, `json_get_string`, `json_get_value`) with Unicode & escape handling.
   - Verified via `fixtures/std_map_smoke_proof.oo` and `fixtures/json_parser_smoke_proof.oo`.

2. RTB-2: I/O & Networking Floor (std/time/chrono.oo & std/net/http.oo)
   - Monotonic high-resolution timing, sleep, elapsed measurement, and duration formatting under `&TimeCap`.
   - HTTP client fetch, status parsing, body extraction, and header serialization under `&NetCap`.
   - Verified via `fixtures/chrono_smoke_proof.oo` and `fixtures/http_smoke_proof.oo`.

3. RTB-3: CLI Developer Workflow (cli/cli_init.oo & cli/cli_doc.oo)
   - Package scaffolding generating standard layout, `ooda.json` manifest, `src/main.oo`, and `tests/test_main.oo` under `&SysCap`.
   - Automated Markdown doc generator extracting `# Title`, `// Logline:`, and `pub fn` signatures.
   - Verified via `fixtures/cli_workflow_smoke_proof.oo`.

4. RTB-4: Rich Compiler Diagnostics (cli/diag_fmt.oo)
   - Visual diagnostic formatter with 1-based source context, location arrows, and carets (`^^^^`).
   - Verified via `fixtures/diag_visual_smoke_proof.oo`.

5. RTB-5: Concurrency & Synchronization (std/sync/channel.oo)
   - Bounded thread-safe message channels with POSIX mutex and ring buffers under `&ThreadCap`.
   - Verified via `fixtures/channel_smoke_proof.oo` and `fixtures/pv2_channel_stress_proof.oo`.

6. Core Runtime & Memory Safety Hardening
   - Pure stateless UTF-8 string indexing in `runtime/chs_rt_str.c` (thread-safe without static caches).
   - 8-byte aligned string interning pool in `runtime/chs_rt_str_intern.c`, eliminating UBSan alignment traps.
   - Return-value ARC retention in `oodac/c_emit_arc_2.oo` for composite struct types (`Result[String, String]`).

7. 12-Agent Super Swarm 360-Degree Validation
   - Complete multi-perspective audit across Engineering (DE1, DE2, RT), Adversarial (PV1, PV2, SEC, MEM), Integration (INT, HARN, HYG), and Command (DOCS, COORD).
   - Zero memory leaks, zero use-after-free, and zero unclosed file descriptors under AddressSanitizer (ASan).
   - Master architecture roadmap established across 9 tracks (RTB-6 through RTB-32).

## Verification
- `oodac check oodac/main.oo`: 100% PASS across all 177 self-hosted modules.
- 100% Rule 1.7 Compliance (all 1,248 source files strictly <= 256 lines).
- Native Backend-C GCC execution verified across all 18 proof fixtures with zero regressions.
